{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "cae84b43f4512c7cc90b3bca85ae62bedbcf4dd701b7e725551301a5bb383d78", "ja": "フリーダム★アゲイン", "zh": "自由自在★Again", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2ea193922791d1400c5f401119bafe6d76f0d1df9ebf526cfb9fe6b4c686a6c5", "ja": "撮影スタジオに向かった茜は、再び不思議な\n空間に入り込み、麗花（？）と出会う。元の\n麗花に戻して、と心から願う茜。そして……\n目覚めると、まだCM撮影前だった。全ては夢\nだったのか？　それとも……？", "zh": "前往摄影棚的茜，再次进入了不可思议的  \n空间，并遇到了丽花（？）。茜发自内心地  \n祈愿，希望丽花恢复原样。然后……  \n醒来时，CM拍摄还没开始。一切都只是梦  \n吗？还是说……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1000_023aka", "source_sha256": "f3fe2110e844ad7d473834705efaf093c879edf9903da5441d4fc7b1b337ca94", "ja": "はぁっ、はぁっ、はぁっ……！", "zh": "呼、呼、呼……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "a51aa9e5035dfbf48bbaa49d064562419745fa8c152b4ab0d6db8432cf0c0fa0", "ja": "CMを撮った、あのスタジオ！\nもう一回あそこに行けば、きっと……！", "zh": "拍广告的那个演播室！\n只要再去一次那里，肯定……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "5b47ca11b6e682ab1333e24a4a3016a5e9f0dc7aed43491ef362062bee727c6f", "ja": "……あ、あれ？　ここは！？　さっきまで、\nスタジオに向かって走ってたはずなのに……。", "zh": "……奇、奇怪？这里是！？明明刚才\n还在朝着摄影棚跑才对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1003_048rei", "source_sha256": "aed525752c72bc0ae1c40fc1b9482539de993964295c3d2646ab4daf7cf047f8", "ja": "ふふふふっ。私が呼んであげたの。\n茜ちゃん、私に会いたかったんでしょう？", "zh": "呵呵呵呵。我把你叫过来了。\n小茜，你很想见我吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "b650a51add0e0645e5a6b6ab99aa2d99f2ccb1d1b432d232e91e49363755db04", "ja": "あっ！\nあの時の、ちょっとヘンな麗花ちゃん！？", "zh": "啊！\n那时候那个有点奇怪的丽花！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "2233019dc59f8e72472e8d151542c0de397ea11961cf6089bb12ba845d24e2d2", "ja": "あ、あのね、この前のお願い、取り消せる？\n元の麗花ちゃんに戻してほしくて……お願いっ！", "zh": "啊，那个……之前的请求，可以取消吗？\n我想让丽花亲变回原来的样子……拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "4fa9f5cd168bdd585d11a1875427eeb30a08e260b62f763722c81935921bacbe", "ja": "ふふっ。だーめ♪", "zh": "呵呵，不行哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "ddef88ea2af9df3b4fe427a72f837a3867f7acb080e4ea62fce0a1d6f8ff6059", "ja": "ニャー！？　ナ、ナンデ！？", "zh": "喵！？为、为什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "2a0d87c4ba057cb57b1e5f9821c074da0f57c2fd9128945caefec037c3aa2706", "ja": "私、あの時、もう二度とないチャンスだって言ったよ？\nそれに、よく考えてみて。", "zh": "我说过了吧？那是个千载难逢的机会。\n而且，你好好想想看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "905fd8605c02cf990c9b6783e2ba5bddb2040690b37e2b63a9318f19d2238050", "ja": "今のままの麗花ちゃんのほうが、茜ちゃんは幸せな\nはず。好きなだけ目立てるし、優しくしてもらえるし。", "zh": "对小茜来说，还是现在这样的丽花更幸福才对。想多显眼都可以，也会被温柔对待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "d457159dbee2bcd4b46383c217e48292ea20afb9a3af6c0ab567710faa2edad4", "ja": "見たこともない場所に連れて行かれることもなければ、\n冷蔵庫のプリンだって食べられずに済むんだよ？", "zh": "又不会被带去从未见过的地方，冰箱里的布丁也不会被人吃掉，不是挺好的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "da51a60fdb7bd6f6dbbbb7b83f812a661385115318aaaf00684a28880301c473", "ja": "確かに、そうかもしれないけど……。\nでも茜ちゃんは……茜ちゃんは……。", "zh": "确实，也许是这样……。\n但是小茜……小茜……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1012_023aka", "source_sha256": "1064844fa49153ad1994c6481db5a16f73ca1bde9f24275bf2b7420f0d97f81d", "ja": "そんなハチャメチャな麗花ちゃんが、好きなんだもん！\n麗花ちゃんは、麗花ちゃんじゃなきゃダメなんだよ～！", "zh": "因为我就是喜欢这样乱来的丽花嘛！\n丽花必须是丽花才行哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "fbdf12f0c68805f0dc3018ee42bd9ead70746c8affffe88d20bfcb544e17cef2", "ja": "ふう～ん……。", "zh": "嗯～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "651351d4e0486edca63f1bef448e822283e39f358c19f751cbab3e09aac99db0", "ja": "そこまで言うなら、元に戻してあげようかな。\nでも一度願ったことを取り消すには、代償が必要なの。", "zh": "既然你都这么说了，那我就帮你恢复原状吧。\n不过，想要收回曾经许下的愿望，可是需要付出代价的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1015_023aka", "source_sha256": "0db260ea65b663113df2dc3fd522a2103a9a71f86bcb8f61cba3d5313d5293b7", "ja": "だ、代償？", "zh": "代、代价？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1016_048rei", "source_sha256": "a165d2c09aca8d2181ef241f101d22c4f6e997b8a325903ca53124899a79e48d", "ja": "そう。これから先ずっと、茜ちゃんのプリンは\n麗花ちゃんに食べられてしまうけど……それでもいい？", "zh": "没错。今后，小茜的布丁都会被丽花吃掉……即便如此也没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1018_048rei", "source_sha256": "cf624f609ebe86e9793baddd5ce8837914d069ffcbdb9d9ec9f55ed40d76821a", "ja": "やっぱり、茜ちゃんには難しかったかな？\nプリン、大好きだもんね。", "zh": "果然，对小茜来说还是太难了吗？\n毕竟你最喜欢布丁嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1019_048rei", "source_sha256": "4b95384cb5a9d4ff8a95657d0c8c468ea65688a95b35892cb4e1d16e21907b3d", "ja": "私なら、プリンなんかいらないよ。\n茜ちゃんのプリンを、勝手に食べたりもしない。", "zh": "如果是我的话，才不需要什么布丁呢。\n也不会擅自吃掉小茜的布丁。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1020_048rei", "source_sha256": "fea13f9e65665893bdfd7853e1c2aaeb528c21fe1575b0abf3aec827a84006d3", "ja": "ね？　私と友達になろう？\nだからもう、前の麗花ちゃんのことは……。", "zh": "对吧？和我做朋友吧？\n所以，之前的丽花就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1021_023aka", "source_sha256": "d12f4f8746562f90f809b9bea14cc3c6eaf2e237405266793af90b6008a26dc8", "ja": "……いいよ！！", "zh": "……好啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1022_048rei", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1023_023aka", "source_sha256": "0c06757234302990480e75b9b3276b4fbf02395f3529e42136be11043a7297a5", "ja": "いいよ！　茜ちゃんのプリンくらいあげるよ！　だから\n……だから元の麗花ちゃんに、戻してよーーーっ！！", "zh": "给你就是了！小茜的布丁分你总行了吧！所以\n……所以把原来的丽花还给我啊——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1024_048rei", "source_sha256": "0877471c06828cde9060842a21a22a2406d18e1da5330cc6ff0147480d5c8060", "ja": "……そう。せっかく、……なら……\n……なれると……思った……の……に……。", "zh": "……这样啊。难得……如果……\n……我还以为……能成为……的……呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1025_se", "source_sha256": "14e6c8704944be5519c134708d6b64f5cccad5684d879f8954ba4596b0731af2", "ja": "バシッ", "zh": "啪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1026_023aka", "source_sha256": "e38722160f39ac3016ec472d7a962b5ac0d4eb1c797793bbf07a2226bc0f7e85", "ja": "はっ！！　今の音は……あ、あれ？\nここは……。", "zh": "啊！！刚才的声音是……啊，咦？这里是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1027_046rio", "source_sha256": "c2a6f53b1e80336b4c60db1bd1d85ba98ba647f5b1238e44b3be192e98e271dc", "ja": "あ、起きた！　{$P$}くん、\n茜ちゃん、起きたわよ。", "zh": "啊，你醒了！{$P$}，\n小茜，醒过来了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1028_p", "source_sha256": "76b52184a3582bbaa0b67fedcecb15f2000a5f037e6376defd38e84de7b3ebaa", "ja": "よかった、全然起きないから心配したぞ。\n体調が悪くないなら、打ち合わせ再開するけど……。", "zh": "太好了，你一直都没醒，可把我担心坏了。\n如果身体没不舒服，那就继续开会了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1029_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0f80b1b1680b4a57aae95d0123876bd59ce1b4e06f3dc096b3ef0f883a691f63", "ja": "気分が悪いなら、すこし休んでたほうがいいかも。\nスポーツドリンクがあるけど、飲める？", "zh": "如果感觉不舒服，还是稍微休息一下比较好。\n这里有运动饮料，喝得下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1030_023aka", "source_sha256": "0dbd3c9ab92ef7580fa1917d9064540842cd86fdcc64f6b1009bcf8cc1940267", "ja": "あ、ありがとう、風花ちゃん。\nけど、打ち合わせ……？", "zh": "啊，谢谢你，风花。\n不过，开会……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1031_023aka", "source_sha256": "910fc4516ad73cb256941910aba91abf230add3eca217a348ecdf3de12aeba6d", "ja": "今日って、ハロウィンイベントの\n当日じゃなかったっけ？", "zh": "今天不是万圣节活动的当天吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1032_046rio", "source_sha256": "48a677e13445d41028e523e4b8fd5135fe1e537aa7037040857701b4cb808fd1", "ja": "やだ、寝ぼけてるの？　今日は私と風花ちゃんの撮影、\n茜ちゃん達は見学と打ち合わせでしょ？　……あら？", "zh": "讨厌啦，你睡糊涂了吗？今天是我和风花的拍摄，\n小茜她们是来参观和开会的吧？……哎呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1033_046rio", "source_sha256": "befed91e9d7b79527345e11b8514d0f816be16d1ed76f7063523ae8e05b6db31", "ja": "茜ちゃん。そのプリン、\nどこかで買ってきたの？", "zh": "小茜。那个布丁，\n是在哪里买的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1034_023aka", "source_sha256": "a4d8173f6a106a28f1866fd3d133067a31caad444521e5f69d6ec9c9efb5d439", "ja": "え……？　あっ。", "zh": "诶……？啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1035_023aka", "source_sha256": "849802e6f888da1ec5d7e1a60c267f6e2ce0bad57a4d9ced4a42bb17de9d7ea7", "ja": "これは……『茜ちゃんプリン』！？\nゆ、夢じゃなかったんだ！", "zh": "这是……“小茜布丁”！？\n原来、不是在做梦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1036_048rei", "source_sha256": "8a2edcf82c3bbfed591dd76c9fcb983847e166abbb646db2f9fff4831ef3991e", "ja": "何が夢じゃなかったの？", "zh": "什么不是梦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1037_023aka", "source_sha256": "1d4be08370cf71fc58b2d0662e9a38d43de11d23c7f95672b525d127b0d1acbc", "ja": "ウニャーーー！！？\nれ、れれれ、麗花ちゃん！？", "zh": "喵呜——！！？\n丽、丽丽丽、丽花！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1038_023aka", "source_sha256": "dc6e6806690fd231051ac34af3c3835ea63f6da88692ab4690da95b24ac4a105", "ja": "えっと……。念のために聞くけど、\nおとなしい麗花ちゃん……じゃないよね？", "zh": "那个……我再确认一下，\n你不是那个老实的丽花吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1039_048rei", "source_sha256": "191034ba157ea890c1ad671cda636383b13b61c238d8cf80758e27c4e63ca7d6", "ja": "おとなしい私……？　あっ、もしかして百面相のこと？\n私、けっこう得意なんだよね。あっぷっぷ～♪", "zh": "安静的我……？啊，难道你说的是变脸吗？\n我还挺擅长的呢。鼓起脸颊～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1040_023aka", "source_sha256": "db78bf77fb16942c875ace81af9b73d8a6390b5308862b3d5b1e5c28c5e2161d", "ja": "これこれ！　この斜め上の反応！！\nいつもの麗花ちゃん！　いつもの麗花ちゃんだよ！！", "zh": "就是这个！这种出人意料的反应！！\n这才是平时的丽花！就是平时的丽花！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1041_023aka", "source_sha256": "ae4d91acb2e072ace59e673b863169f05521d54912b953414d4b8ee862525844", "ja": "よかった……本当に、よかった……！！\nグスッ……うえええ～ん！　びええ～！！", "zh": "太好了……真的，太好了……！！\n抽泣……呜呜呜～！哇啊啊～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1042_048rei", "source_sha256": "ba5c6195920378733b11f3f2f87a329affeb59bd40f9476df09dbf3086ff3192", "ja": "茜ちゃん……？", "zh": "小茜……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1043_p", "source_sha256": "b8d7c71c57440498da775bddd6f8eedb1f5954fec3a1f60e6a260f03af498bab", "ja": "あ、茜、どうしたんだ！？", "zh": "啊，茜，你怎么了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1044_048rei", "source_sha256": "4572601c372eff9bbf44ade0593e527ba277dfe923f61d0d9d4e80fb2357e68b", "ja": "……ふふ。よくわからないけど、大丈夫だよ。\n私は、どこにも行かないからね。ナデナデ♪", "zh": "……呵呵。虽然不太明白，但没关系哦。\n我哪里都不会去的。摸摸♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1045_046rio", "source_sha256": "6c521711cfe3d2b5f7f79901c0837294747a51057acb453f455ef86b778bce57", "ja": "理由はわからないけど、なんだかホッとするわね。\n……茜ちゃんが泣いてるのに、どうしてなのかしら。", "zh": "虽然不知道原因，但总觉得松了口气呢。\n……明明小茜正在哭，我怎么会有这种感觉呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_06_1046_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d89882699a70d87f9b76b542af50c69caf71a40b6129a1456f1a71d0079d4023", "ja": "そうですね……とっても、安心する光景ですね。\nそれがどうしてなのかは、わかりませんけど……。", "zh": "是啊……真是让人非常安心的景象呢。\n虽然我也不知道为什么会这样……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
